ked along and he looked me  up and down and looked at my transcript  for all my subjects he said you should  be a maths teacher  you know you've obviously you've got a  background that you can do this there's  this immense need and because I just  wanted to be in a place where I could  serve students serve a community and be  maximally useful  that's the direction that I went in but  aside from that practical reason of  alright well I guess here's where I can  be beneficial people the longer I've  taught mathematics the more I've come to  see it's a thing of immense practical  usefulness it's a lens for seeing the  world and gain new perspective on things  and it also is in its own way beautiful  our thing to be appreciated there are  patterns all around us that just kind of  fly past us that we don't notice them  but mathematics gives us the tools to  understand what's really going on  [Music]
 

